    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can you reach the void? Can you bring Galduen to the void? </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The three races of Galduen have finally stopped their fratricidal wars, united by the promise of reaching the stars! You now need to manage your space agency, design your spaceship, and research new technology!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863130/extras/4c24eacc757ff0548b33da2886a649b9.poster.avif?t=1753286326\" width=610 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863130/extras/4c24eacc757ff0548b33da2886a649b9.webm?t=1753286326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863130/extras/4c24eacc757ff0548b33da2886a649b9.mp4?t=1753286326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the strange worlds of the Galduen system!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Galduen star system is full of enigmatic worlds, caused by the violent solar storms of the Helio star. Understanding them will be a hard task.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop new technology to reach the stars!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your agency to the height of scientific discovery, from better engines to solar sail probes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build spaceships!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your spaceship for the task ahead, from solar sail probes to crewed spaceships.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Send them to the stars!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your astronauts to walk upon the moons and even different planets. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863130/extras/1c767efa1b4cb557a3865993bda75456.avif?t=1753286326\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build outposts!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon the many celestial bodies of the system, outposts can be built to speed your expansion.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the secrets of Galduen!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galduen possesses a distinct culture and religion influenced by the stars. Discover how space exploration reshapes their society.</p>",
