ss=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863130/extras/1c767efa1b4cb557a3865993bda75456.avif?t=1753286326\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build outposts!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon the many celestial bodies of the system, outposts can be built to speed your expansion.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the secrets of Galduen!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galduen possesses a distinct culture and religion influenced by the stars. Discover how space exploration reshapes their society.</p>",
